# Normalize line endings
* text=auto

# Ensure shell scripts use LF to avoid /bin/sh carriage-return errors in devcontainers
*.sh text eol=lf

# The architecture model is a 42MB generated artifact (memql#2844).
#
# -diff: GitHub's diff API times out generating a patch for it -- measured, on
# the PR that first sorted it, which reordered all 1.26M lines. That failed the
# `changes` job (dorny/paths-filter reads the diff), which fails `ci-required`,
# which blocks the PR. Marking it non-diffable makes GitHub report a binary
# change instead of computing the patch.
#
# This costs nothing a reviewer wanted: nobody reads a 42MB JSON diff, and
# correctness is established by TestArchitectureModelIsCurrent, which
# regenerates and compares. `git diff --text` still shows the real change
# locally when you want it -- and thanks to the sort, that is now ~37 lines for
# a one-function change rather than 903,237.
#
# linguist-generated: keeps it out of language stats and collapses it in review.
component/architecture/embedded/topology.model.json -diff linguist-generated=true
